 server invite to your clipboard.\n\nPremium (3): Unlocks three exclusive premium-only features.\n\nOffset X: Adjust the X-axis positioning used by automated features.\n\nOffset Y: Adjust the Y-axis positioning used by automated features.\n\nOffset Z: Adjust the Z-axis positioning used by automated features.\n\nSelect Target: Choose a specific player for automated combat features.\n\nAuto Combo: Automatically performs attack combos against your target.\n\nAuto Attack: Continuously attacks nearby enemies without manual input.\n\nKill Aura: Automatically attacks enemies within your selected range.\n\nAuto Dash: Automatically dashes toward opponents during combat.\n\nAuto Block: Automatically blocks incoming attacks when possible.\n\nTeleport Behind Target: Instantly moves behind the selected player.\n\nPlayer ESP: Highlights all players through walls for easier tracking.\n\nHealth ESP: Displays each player's current health.\n\nName ESP: Shows player names above their characters.\n\nDistance ESP: Displays the distance to every player.\n\nTracers: Draws lines from your screen to players for improved awareness.\n\nAimbot: Automatically aims at your selected target.\n\nFOV Circle: Customize the aimbot's targeting radius.\n\nSmooth Aim: Makes aimbot movements appear more natural.\n\nWalk Speed: Customize your movement speed.\n\nJump Power: Customize how high your character jumps.\n\nInfinite Jump: Jump endlessly without touching the ground.\n\nFly: Freely fly around the map using keyboard controls.\n\nNoClip: Walk through walls and other solid objects.\n\nFullbright: Removes dark lighting to improve visibility.\n\nNo Fog: Removes fog effects for a clearer view.\n\nFPS Boost: Improves performance by disabling unnecessary visual effects.\n\nAnti-AFK: Prevents automatic kicks for being idle.\n\nServer Hop: Quickly join a different server.\n\nRejoin Server: Instantly reconnect to your current server.\nThe Strongest Battle Grounds, Strongest Battle Grounds, Battle Grounds, SBG,